{"ref":"BDB, מַסָּה⁴","hw":"מַסָּה⁴","html":"† II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מַסָּה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. test</strong>, trial, proving;—cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַסַּת</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 9:23\" href=\"/Job.9.23\">Jb 9:23</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַסֹּת</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 4:34\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.4.34\">Dt 4:34</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 7:19\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.7.19\">7:19</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מסּוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 29:2\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.29.2\">Dt 29:2</a>:—<em>testings</em> or <em>provings</em> of Pharaoh and Egyptians at Exodus, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 4:34\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.4.34\">Dt 4:34</a> (v. Dr), <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 7:19\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.7.19\">7:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 29:2\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.29.2\">29:2</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אֹתֹת</span>);—<em>test, trial</em>, of innocent person <a data-ref=\"Job 9:23\" href=\"/Job.9.23\">Jb 9:23</a> according to Hi al., but v. i. <a data-ref=\"BDB, מַסָּה³\" href=\"/BDB,_מַסָּה³\", dir=\"rtl\">מַסָּה</a> sub <a data-ref=\"BDB, מָסַס\" href=\"/BDB,_מָסַס\", dir=\"rtl\">מסס</a>.","next":"BDB, מַסָּה⁵","prev":"BDB, נָסָה"}